<title>USA: Connecticut says to sell $150 mln bonds next week.</title>
<headline>Connecticut says to sell $150 mln bonds next week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Connecticut plans to sell $150 million special tax obligations next Tuesday, a state official said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The underwriter will be JP Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
